{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/538808-recruiting-into-the-darkness-crossover-roll20-nwod-gmc-game","id":538808,"title":"[Recruiting] Into the darkness crossover roll20 (nwod-gmc) game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-03T14:41:47-07:00","id":538808,"title":"[Recruiting] Into the darkness crossover roll20 (nwod-gmc) game","content":"<i>We write the year of 1923. The great war has eneded a few years ago. You managed to get a ticket for a cruise ship the Charon which will travel from Hamburg to New York in a mere 6 days! The chance of a life time you thought.......The end of the old times and a time for a new begin in the US......that is at least what you thought you would never have guessed what would happen during this cruise or how it ended. Else you would have woken up at night with cold sweat streaming down your face while you scream at the top of your lungs.</i><br /> <br /> ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> This campaign is planed as a crossover adventure where the characters start in 1923 during the first adventure. At the end of it they have the options to use the same character in modern times, play as a relative of their old character, play a new character (the first option only if they survive). <br /> <br /> This adventure in special but also the remainder of the campaign are planed to be horror stories (with a heavy old school horror focus). The adventures are brutal and there is a good chance for character death. But these warnings aside the campaign itself is planed as a crossover campaign thus players can be of different splats. The first adventure is best played as a mere human but even here options are existing to play already as a non human (for human first there is a good option at th eend of that adventure to switch the characters splat).<br /> <br /> The game is planed to be every 1-2 weeks set on fridays.<br /> <br /> <br /> More details can be seen here:<br /> <a href=\"https://app.roll20.net/lfg/listing/26192/into-the-darkness-crossover-campaign\" target=\"_blank\">https://app.roll20.net/lfg/listing/2...sover-campaign</a><br /> <br /> I'm looking for 2-3 more players (already got one).<br /> <br /> Languagewise it would be english or german (if at least 1 english only player is in the game it will be english languagewise).<br /> <br /> If you have any questions or want to join feel free to post here, pm me or post so on roll20.<br /> <br /> Thanks<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T08:14:57-07:00","id":539542,"title":"","content":"This sounds amazing, I would love to join, but unfortunately Friday mornings isn't possible for me. If you end up changing the schedule I would be very interested, but otherwise best of luck and have fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T08:22:46-07:00","id":539575,"title":"","content":"Friday mornings works fine for me. When I get home from work later tonight, I will look into it more. I would like to do something like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}